[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11406.946, "timestamp": "03:10:06", "text": "對，大概是2017年，還是2016年？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11418.469, "timestamp": "03:10:18", "text": "我想應該是2017年。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11451.269, "timestamp": "03:10:51", "text": "所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11455.11, "timestamp": "03:10:55", "text": "記得有時候我在電腦滑鼠上畫漢字的時候，畫出來的字總是看起來很滑稽。"}]